<Base title="About — Field Notes" description="Who writes here and why.">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    I work on AI tooling evaluation: building the task books, acceptance scripts and reporting
    pipelines that decide whether an AI coding agent is actually usable, or only looks usable in
    the demo.
  </p>

  <p>
    Field Notes is where the reusable part of that work goes — the method rather than the
    announcement. If a number appears here, it came out of a script that can be re-run.
  </p>

  <h2>What you will and will not find</h2>

  <p>
    Published: evaluation methodology, failure taxonomies, pipeline notes, and the occasional
    write-up of something that broke in a way worth remembering.
  </p>

  <p>
    Not published: anything under an NDA, anything about a specific employer's internals, and
    anything I have not been able to reproduce myself.
  </p>

